# 루트 build context에서 실행에 필요한 파일만 허용한다.
**
!requirements.lock.txt
!pipeline.py
!modules/
!modules/**/
!modules/**/*.py
!modules/**/*.schema.json
!modules/access_analyzer/configs/access_analyzer.toml
!modules/collector/configs/collector.example.toml
!modules/knowledge_graph/configs/default.json
!modules/scenario_generator/configs/scenario_generator.toml
!modules/semantic_analyzer/configs/default.toml
!modules/verifier/configs/verifier.toml
!local_web/
!local_web/__init__.py
!local_web/server.py
!local_web/inputs.py
!local_web/frontend/
!local_web/frontend/*.html
!local_web/frontend/*.css
!local_web/frontend/*.js
# 모듈 테스트·개인 기록·runtime 데이터는 이미지에 넣지 않는다.
modules/*/tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/private/
**/runs/
**/data/
